==Mandarin==

===Etymology===
Probably an abbreviation of the English "[[post]] [[online]]".

===Verb===
{{infl|cmn|verb}}

# {{context|label=slang, Taiwanese media|topcat=Slang|lang=zh}} To [[post]] an [[article]] [[online]]; to [[upload]] something [[online]]
